      "side": 1,
      "message": "So with iterm on Mac, plus tmux on the remote machine, this seems to work fine when I make the terminal bigger (zoom into the pane, so one large jump). Doing the reverse -- going from the full screen to a quarter screen (un-zoom), I get a bunch of blank lines, from the top of my new status line past the top of the (new) screen, and into the tmux scrollback. After those blank lines I find my previous status line.\n\nI highly suspect this is more to do with tmux than iterm, since the scrollback is within tmux, not iterm.",
